<title>USA: Sherwood completes Dresdner-NY acquisition.</title>
<headline>Sherwood completes Dresdner-NY acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG and Sherwood Group Inc said Friday that Sherwood has completed the acquisition of Dresdner - New York, a specialist handling 54 securities on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Sherwood's acquisition of all the stock of Dresdner - New York was announced in April and includes four seats on the NYSE.</p>
<p>Sherwood, which has a limited partnership interest in Equitrade Partners, said the acquisition has received the approval of the NYSE and the Federal Trade Commission.</p>
<p>It said it will fund the deal from internal resources.</p>
